/T (You have been told to carefully check the information within the Bail Order. Other inmates have made you aware of the fact that any error within the Bail Order will mean that your release will be pushed back by over a week. You anxiously scan the document and find that there is a dhaara missing. It will need to be sent back. You plan a visit to the DSLSA lawyer for the same. This is going to take a lot of time now. )
