/Title (You have been told to carefully check the information within the Bail Order. Other inmates have made you aware of the fact that any error within the Bail Order will mean that your release will be pushed back by over a week. You anxiously scan the document and find that there is a dhaara missing. It will need to be sent back. You plan a visit to the DSLSA lawyer for the same. This is going to take a lot of time now.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 670 0 R
/Next 656 0 R
>>
endobj
669 0 obj
<<
/Title (On the day of your hearing, you wait for your case to be called. Your lawyer is confident it will work out, but you are feeling really anxious. You are unable to find your parents in the room, but at least your sister is present. You try to keep cognizance of the proceedings, but are unable to focus on anything except your own breathing. Thankfully by the end, the judge announces that bail will be granted on the date of the next hearing.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
