/Title (Your fellow inmates have informed you that once the Bail Order arrives, a series of steps need to be followed to acquire the Release Order, which is what will finally allow you to return home. Your Bail Order arrives the night before Gandhi Jayanti, and you only hear of it after the long weekend ends. There is endless red-tape to be parsed, and you are already exhausted.)
